{
  "slug": "npm-postinstall-attack-scanner",
  "name": "Npm Postinstall Attack Scanner",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Detect npm supply chain attacks that use the postinstall + hidden dependency pattern to deliver malware. Built in response to the axios maintainer account takeover (2026-03-31). Scans lockfiles, ode_modules, postinstall scripts, version ranges, and npm cache across 5 phases. Returns actionable remediation steps when issues are found.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `claude-code` (Detect npm supply chain attacks using the postinstall + hidden dependency pattern).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install npm-postinstall-attack-scanner@claude-community` from `aliksir/npm-postinstall-attack-scanner`.\n\nDetects npm supply chain attacks that use the postinstall + hidden dependency pattern to deliver malware.",
